    - target: {fileID: 4711005256018735203, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Oats was created in March - June 2025, in private as well as two project
        weeks as part of the mmp2b project at the FH Salzburg, in collaboration with
        another student.


        Gameplay:

        Oats is a 3D real time strategy
        base defense game. Players control multiple troops of pigs and send them
        out to defend heaps of oats from an onslaught of various enemies with different
        types and effects. Pigs can be upgraded throughout the game and change their
        default type with 3 different types to choose from. Basic stats from the
        pigs can also be upgraded, and new troops can be purchased, depending of
        the amount of oats you have in your pile. This amount increases depending
        on how many heaps survived the round. With each successful round, more enemies
        spawn. If the player ever runs out of oats or troops, they loose.


        What
        I id:

        Some Game Design

        Some Game Logic

        Entity
        Pathfinding & AI

        Shader coding


        Made with:

        C#,
        Unity & Blender '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
